## 3. GUI Implementation Refactoring

### Current Implementation
- Fyne GUI implementation in `gui.go` (conditionally compiled with `fyne_gui` build tag)
- Alternative Next.js implementation in `altgui.go` (compiled when `fyne_gui` is not set)
- WebView integration for displaying the UI

### Proposed Changes
- Completely remove the Fyne GUI implementation
- Repurpose the Next.js implementation as a browser-only Node.js service
- Rename to "Developer Portal" served only by the Rootnode
- Remove all WebView dependencies
- Configure and launch the Developer Portal as a Node.js service, similar to Payment Gateway and Tunnel Registry

### Implementation Details
