- Terminal UI is optional, enabled with `--terminal` flag
- Competes with GUI implementations

### Proposed Changes
- Make BubbleTea terminal the default interface without any flag requirement
- Ensure it works across all role-specific binaries
- Improve terminal UI for better user experience

### Implementation Details
1. Update `main.go`:
   - Remove `useTerminal` flag
   - Make BubbleTea terminal the default UI for all roles
   - Update UI initialization logic

   
2. Enhance `main_bubbletea.go`:
   - Improve terminal UI components for better usability
   - Add role-specific views and functionality
   - Ensure compatibility with all roles

3. Update configuration handling:
   - Remove GUI-related configuration options
   - Add terminal UI configuration options
   - Ensure terminal UI works with minimal configuration

